### 9. PAGE 5 — BUG CEMETERY

This page should be one of DARKIT's most memorable branded experiences.

Heading:

`THE BUG CEMETERY`

Subtitle:

`Every unresolved bug has a story. Give it a proper investigation.`

Design a dark, illustrated cemetery with subtle gravestones, small pumpkins, lanterns, drifting ghosts, and a faint layer of mist.

