### 16. MICRO-INTERACTIONS & ANIMATION

Create a coherent animation system.

Recommended effects:
- Ghosts gently float up and down.
- Tiny ghosts occasionally peek around panel edges.
- Pumpkins glow softly on hover.
- Lanterns produce a subtle light pulse.
- Embers drift slowly in the background.
- Terminal cursor blinks gently.
- Navigation transitions are smooth.
- Cards lift slightly on hover.
- XP progress animates when updated.
- Achievement unlocks produce a short celebratory effect.
- Loading ghosts move slowly while requests are processing.

Animations should be purposeful and restrained.

Do not:
- Flash the screen.
- Make text jitter constantly.
- Apply heavy glitch effects to the entire page.
- Animate every card simultaneously.
- Prevent users from reading content.
- Use motion that causes accessibility problems.

Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

