### 20. WHAT TO AVOID

Do not create:
- A generic dark AI dashboard.
- A generic SaaS admin template with orange buttons.
- A simple Halloween landing page without the real product workflows.
- A page made entirely from black rectangles.
- A design that depends on purple neon gradients.
- An interface filled with giant emoji.
- Random pumpkins with no visual relationship to the product.
- A different illustration style for every ghost.
- Excessive orange glow around every element.
- Tiny, low-contrast text.
- Overly rounded cards everywhere.
- Unnecessary glassmorphism.
- Decorative animations that slow the interface down.
- Fake analysis data presented as real.
- Placeholder navigation with no meaningful destinations.
- Static mockups that ignore mobile layouts.

The product should feel like a carefully designed developer tool with a Halloween soul—not a Halloween poster pretending to be software.

